styles/
__pycache__/
# Local-only upstream docs (vim help files, Obsidian help pages). See refs/README.md.
refs/
# Shale's own per-vault state: its config, theme files, and (from roadmap P1) the
# database and cache. A picked theme is rewritten into the config, so a vault's
# `.shale/` is state the app owns and the tree should not carry.
.shale/
# …except the demo vault's config, which is the template and the documentation of
# every key, so it is tracked. Its sibling state (theme files, the DB, the lock,
# pending edits) stays ignored, and so does every other vault's `.shale/`. The cost
# of tracking it: picking a theme in the demo vault rewrites `appearance.theme` and
# dirties the tree on purpose.
!examples/demo-vault/.shale/
examples/demo-vault/.shale/*
!examples/demo-vault/.shale/config.toml
